{
  "note": "Synthetic server frames for what the recording (S13-live) lacks: super chats, filter cases, other rooms, escaped text, broken packets. Each case is one WebSocket frame; every string is one packet body framed as the server does (type 690, little endian, UTF-8 length); {\"headerLength\": n} is a bare 12-byte header claiming length n; \"cut\" drops that many bytes from the end of the frame. \"filter\" turns on the suspected-automated filter.",
